{
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "slug": "progress-bar",
  "title": "Progress bar",
  "group": "Feedback",
  "order": 3,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A 6 px track that fills as a task with a known size advances. Show the number next to it; use the indeterminate bar only when you truly cannot measure.",
    "id": "Track 6 px yang terisi seiring tugas dengan ukuran yang diketahui berjalan. Tampilkan angkanya di samping; pakai bar indeterminate hanya jika benar-benar tidak bisa diukur."
  },
  "titleId": "Progress bar",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Determinate with its number",
        "desc": "The label says what is happening, the number says how far. Press the button to advance it.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 420px;\">\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"progress-meta\"><span id=\"pb-l\">Uploading business-site-plan.pdf</span><b id=\"pb-v\">36%</b></div>\n    <div class=\"progress\" id=\"pb\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-labelledby=\"pb-l\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"36\"><div class=\"progress__fill\" style=\"transform: scaleX(0.36);\"></div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"docs-row\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" onclick=\"const b = document.getElementById('pb'); const v = (Number(b.getAttribute('aria-valuenow')) + 21) % 105; b.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', v); b.firstElementChild.style.transform = 'scaleX(' + v / 100 + ')'; document.getElementById('pb-v').textContent = v + '%';\">Advance</button></div>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"progress-meta\"><span id=\"up-l\">Uploading business-site-plan.pdf</span><b>64%</b></div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-labelledby=\"up-l\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"64\">\n  <div class=\"progress__fill\" style=\"transform: scaleX(0.64);\"></div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Training progress",
        "desc": "Counted things read better as \"12 of 20\" than as a percentage. The thin bar fits inside cards and list rows.",
        "html": "<div class=\"card\" style=\"max-width: 360px;\">\n  <div class=\"card__title\">Simple bookkeeping for UMKM</div>\n  <div class=\"card__sub\">Module 3: recording cash flow</div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 16px;\">\n    <div class=\"progress-meta\"><span>Sessions</span><b>12 of 20</b></div>\n    <div class=\"progress progress--thin\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Sessions done\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"20\" aria-valuenow=\"12\" aria-valuetext=\"12 of 20 sessions\"><div class=\"progress__fill\" style=\"transform: scaleX(0.6);\"></div></div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Indeterminate",
        "desc": "A segment sweeps across while the length is unknown. Pair it with words that set expectations.",
        "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 420px; width: 100%;\">\n  <div class=\"progress-meta\"><span>Preparing your certificate letter</span><span>Usually under a minute</span></div>\n  <div class=\"progress progress--thin progress--indeterminate\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Preparing your certificate letter\"><div class=\"progress__fill\"></div></div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Finished",
        "desc": "At 100 % the fill can turn to the success color; say \"Done\" in words too.",
        "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 420px; width: 100%;\">\n  <div class=\"progress-meta\"><span>Report exported</span><b>Done</b></div>\n  <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Report export\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"100\"><div class=\"progress__fill\" style=\"transform: scaleX(1); background: var(--success);\"></div></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Determinate dengan angkanya",
        "desc": "Label menyebut apa yang sedang terjadi, angka menyebut sejauh mana. Tekan tombol untuk memajukannya.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 420px;\">\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"progress-meta\"><span id=\"pb-l\">Mengunggah denah-lokasi-usaha.pdf</span><b id=\"pb-v\">36%</b></div>\n    <div class=\"progress\" id=\"pb\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-labelledby=\"pb-l\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"36\"><div class=\"progress__fill\" style=\"transform: scaleX(0.36);\"></div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"docs-row\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" onclick=\"const b = document.getElementById('pb'); const v = (Number(b.getAttribute('aria-valuenow')) + 21) % 105; b.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', v); b.firstElementChild.style.transform = 'scaleX(' + v / 100 + ')'; document.getElementById('pb-v').textContent = v + '%';\">Majukan</button></div>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"progress-meta\"><span id=\"up-l\">Mengunggah denah-lokasi-usaha.pdf</span><b>64%</b></div>\n<div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-labelledby=\"up-l\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"64\">\n  <div class=\"progress__fill\" style=\"transform: scaleX(0.64);\"></div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Kemajuan pelatihan",
        "desc": "Hal yang dihitung lebih mudah dibaca sebagai \"12 dari 20\" daripada persentase. Bar tipis muat di dalam card dan baris list.",
        "html": "<div class=\"card\" style=\"max-width: 360px;\">\n  <div class=\"card__title\">Pembukuan sederhana untuk UMKM</div>\n  <div class=\"card__sub\">Modul 3: mencatat arus kas</div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 16px;\">\n    <div class=\"progress-meta\"><span>Materi</span><b>12 dari 20</b></div>\n    <div class=\"progress progress--thin\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Materi selesai\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"20\" aria-valuenow=\"12\" aria-valuetext=\"12 dari 20 materi\"><div class=\"progress__fill\" style=\"transform: scaleX(0.6);\"></div></div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Indeterminate",
        "desc": "Satu segmen menyapu selama lamanya belum diketahui. Pasangkan dengan kata-kata yang memberi gambaran waktu.",
        "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 420px; width: 100%;\">\n  <div class=\"progress-meta\"><span>Menyiapkan surat keterangan Anda</span><span>Biasanya kurang dari satu menit</span></div>\n  <div class=\"progress progress--thin progress--indeterminate\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Menyiapkan surat keterangan Anda\"><div class=\"progress__fill\"></div></div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Selesai",
        "desc": "Di 100 % isian boleh berubah ke warna success; tulis juga \"Selesai\" dengan kata-kata.",
        "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 420px; width: 100%;\">\n  <div class=\"progress-meta\"><span>Laporan diekspor</span><b>Selesai</b></div>\n  <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Ekspor laporan\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"100\"><div class=\"progress__fill\" style=\"transform: scaleX(1); background: var(--success);\"></div></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
  },
  "related": [
    "progress-ring",
    "meter",
    "spinner",
    "upload-progress"
  ]
}
